Matrix elements of the magnetic moment connecting Zeeman eigenstates
The average is done according to the formula:
<i|m|j> = ( ABS(<i|m_X|j>) + ABS(<i|m_Y|j>) + ABS(<i|m_Z|j>) ) / 3

